---
// For Birdwatchers Section
---

<section id="for-birdwatchers" class="for-birdwatchers section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>For birdwatchers, every sighting stays saved.</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Join a guided tour, follow the shared checklist and keep your personal birding history.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🔗</div>
        <h3>Join a Tour</h3>
        <p>Open an invitation link or QR code.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">✓</div>
        <h3>Mark Your Birds</h3>
        <p>Seen, photographed, lifer or favorite.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">📖</div>
        <h3>Keep Your Reports</h3>
        <p>Save tour reports and checklists forever.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="for-birdwatchers-cta">
      <a href="https://followbirds.com/app" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank">Download App</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .for-birdwatchers {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 5.5rem 0;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .for-birdwatchers h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: #111815;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #727272;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    background: #F4EFF6;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid #E8DFD3;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    border-color: #559858;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(47, 125, 50, 0.1);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .feature-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: block;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    color: #111815;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    color: #727272;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .for-birdwatchers-cta {
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .for-birdwatchers {
      padding: 4rem 0;
    }

    .section-header {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .for-birdwatchers h2 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .features {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
